---

---

<article id="about" class="container reveal delay-1">
  <div class="hero">
    <h1><span class="text-gradient">I'm Istvan Toth</span></h1>
    <h2 class="subtitle">Logic Crafter</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="glass-panel content-wrapper">
    <div class="about-text">
      <p>
        For me, coding is far more than a technical skill—it is a <strong
          class="highlight">creative passion</strong
        >. Based in the UK, I specialise in building fast, responsive, and <strong
          class="highlight">mobile-first</strong
        > web applications where user experience (<strong class="highlight"
          >UI/UX</strong
        >) is always the priority.
      </p>
      <p>
        As an advocate of the <strong class="highlight">"vibe-coding"</strong> philosophy,
        I am currently leveraging the power of <strong class="highlight"
          >Google Antigravity</strong
        > to bring ideas to life. My portfolio ranges from retro-style typing games
        to practical, high-impact tools—such as the <strong class="highlight"
          >UK Salary Calculator 2026</strong
        >, which was developed entirely through this innovative approach.
      </p>
      <p>
        I am always keen to explore new challenges and push the boundaries of
        what is possible. Feel free to browse my latest projects and experiments
        below!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-image">
      <div class="image-frame">
        <img src="/profile.png" alt="Istvan Toth Profile" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<style>
  article {
    scroll-margin-top: 100px;
  }

  .hero {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .content-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column-reverse;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .content-wrapper {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
    .about-text {
      flex: 1.2;
    }
    .about-image {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  .image-frame {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
    padding: 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    box-shadow:
      0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4),
      0 0 40px rgba(255, 107, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .image-frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 320px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: calc(var(--border-radius-lg) - 0.5rem);
    object-fit: cover;
    aspect-ratio: 1/1.1;
  }

  /* Decorative glowing orb behind content in glass panel */
  .content-wrapper::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -50px;
    right: -50px;
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    background: var(--accent-gradient);
    filter: blur(140px);
    opacity: 0.25;
    border-radius: 50%;
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
    animation: pulseGlow 10s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }

  p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    position: relative;
  }

  .highlight::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -2px;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent-gradient);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>
